# dist/ is intentionally COMMITTED (not ignored): it is the prebuilt server
# that `npx github:AmitMatat/clokio-mcp` runs directly, with no build step at
# install time. This is what makes the install work even when NODE_ENV=production
# (npm then skips the typescript devDependency, so an install-time build would
# fail). Rebuild with `npm run build` before committing source changes.
